   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Extends the picture past its edges. Set how many pixels to add on each side (Extend canvas: left / top / right / bottom; default 256 left and right).\nThe prompt describes the whole scene. The original part is kept pixel-exact; the seam is feathered.\nBig inputs are resized to about 1.0 megapixels first.\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
